### Создать новую заявку
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/create?employee_id={{employee_id}}
Authorization: Basic {{basicAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": 185,
  "create_employee_id": {{employee_id}},
  "scenario_order_id": 1,
  "ticket_name": "Тестовая заявка",
  "info_for_create": {
    "office_id": {
      "id": 318388,
      "name": "Адыгея"
    }
  }
}

